    {
      "id": "AP02",
      "finding": "Fence, FenceGate and PenMarker base costStuffCount are1/25/30; WorkToBuild70/500/600; MaxHitPoints40/20/100. All allow Metallic/Woody/Stony; gate inherits DoorBase. These are baseDefs before stuff factors.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": ".local-research/animal-pens/RimWorld.CompProperties_AnimalPenMarker.cs",
          "sha256": "1a328691e74f7734c56d3a56c97c71b62dc83cf51e7c76042bdcb2e3704bf11b",
