    {
      "id": "AP03",
      "finding": "Walls, fences and doors have different region/path semantics. Door gives Portal, GetFence gives Fence, ordinary walkable cells Normal and full-fill blocking buildings None. A fence is PassThroughOnly with pathCost80 and fillPercent0.25, not a universal impassable wall.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": ".local-research/housing/Verse.RegionTypeUtility.cs",
          "sha256": "b97f4e1c226d1ef96b0d4c57260dda7501e176d9d9a836cbb7283103b3fd15a8",
