        "PX01"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "AP04",
      "finding": "A marker starts from its district; null or map-edge-touching districts are unenclosed. Region traversal visits Normal and Doorway regions, blocks at doors that roamers cannot pass, and fails if any reached region touches the map edge.",
