    {
      "id": "AP07",
      "finding": "Enclosure state retains direct/connected regions and passable/impassable doors. Door passability changes cause recalculation; building spawn/despawn marks the pen manager dirty. Recompute topology after breaches and gate state changes.",
      "sources": [
        {
