    {
      "id": "AP09",
      "finding": "AcceptsToPen is the intersection of the marker animalFilter and a fixed filter restricted to Roamer animals. UI is ordinary ThingFilterUI; female/male special filters match pawn.gender, both allowed by default. No dedicated age filter is established here.",
