    {
      "id": "AP11",
      "finding": "Target pen must accept the animal, be allowed and reachable. Reachability uses the roper with the animal fenceblocked setting; a human ability to cross fences does not authorize leading a deer across them. Enclosed pens are considered before hitching posts and optional unenclosed destinations.",
      "sources": [
        {
          "file": ".local-research/animal-pens/RimWorld.WorkGiver_TakeToPen.cs",
          "sha256": "728a07f39e46113296a226d68d4791b0d1b88a51060d6b883fc13c7efa025cb1",
