    {
      "id": "AP20",
      "finding": "Native sampled evidence separately verifies normal sex-filter changes, priority rope job, saved bidirectional rope state, movement into the enclosure and release, and a normal held-open gate causing Unenclosed(open door). The deer/buildings were developer-prepared; no probability or construction-time calibration was performed.",
